Description: Swift note - Calm, tactile handwriting & PDF annotation (fork of Xournal++)
 Swift note is a hybrid C++20/GTK3 and Rust handwriting and PDF annotation
 application forked from Xournal++ (1.3.8+dev), designed for Windows 10/11 and
 GNU/Linux (Wayland & X11) with full .xopp file compatibility.
 .
 Key capabilities:
  - 3 switchable solid-opaque layouts (Pure Top Bar, Canvas Pill, Zen Bottom Dock)
  - Non-destructive Blackboard mode with chroma-preserving ink inversion & dual PDF export
  - Quick Pen Slots, Auto-Return Eraser, and Scrble Ink-style single-key shortcuts
  - Close-Up auto-advance magnified writing panel and Vietnamese diacritic-insensitive library
  - Full Xournal++ stylus pressure, Setsquare, Compass, LaTeX, Audio & PDF annotation engine
